OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot sale proposal dropped
OL,4,Aamid objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire beauty spot will
OL,7,Fremain a public open space after plans
OL,8,Fto sell it to a football club were
OL,9,Fabandoned following widespread
OL,10,Fopposition.
OL,12,FIn July, Wyre Forest District Council
OL,13,Fagreed to consider the principle of
OL,14,Fselling 8.5 hectares (21 acres) of the
OL,15,F40-hectare (99-acre) of Burlish Country
OL,16,FPark, also known as Burlish Meadows, to
OL,17,FKidderminster Harriers.
OL,19,FThe decision came after the authority
OL,20,Fvoted on Wednesday to keep the land,
OL,21,Fsituated near Stourport-on-Severn, in
OL,22,Fcouncil ownership.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
